[I] Lua bindings to libmodbus

[T] lua-libmodbus provides Lua bindings to libmodbus for Modbus RTU and TCP
[T] communication. Values are returned directly in tables with 1-based
[T] addressing and errors as nil, message pairs.

[U] https://github.com/etactica/lua-libmodbus

